+| parallel-4 2^9 | 512 | 2048 | 4 | 833.5 | 589.2 | 59.9 | 256 |
+| parallel-4 2^10 | 1024 | 4096 | 4 | 3604.8 | 2748.0 | 117.8 | 284 |
+| parallel-4 2^11 | 2048 | 8192 | 4 | 15248.3 | 14289.7 | 236.1 | 312 |
